==Requirements==
Player must achieve at least one Level 8 or higher Combat Job
==To Start==
Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Rizzle wants you to find his Stolen Sasparilla in Sunstone Valley.
*Find the Stolen Sasparilla
*Return to Rizzle
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"You're new around here, right? Well then I bet you could use a friend that knows how this place works, like me!<br />Now since we're friends, and friends help each other, why don't you help me <font color="#CE7C28">find</font> my <font color="#CE7C28">Stolen Sasparilla</font>? You know, since we're friends." -Rizzle
#Find the Stolen Sasparilla
#*There are 5 Stolen Sasparilla barrels scattered South-East of [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]].
#Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Way to go, <player Name>! I was worried I would never see those wonderful barrels of joy again, but you really pulled through." -Rizzle

